{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36889","headline":"奉使宛陵别二三从事 · 罗隐","name":"奉使宛陵别二三从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁王雪里有深知，偶别家乡隔路岐。\n官品共传胜曩日，酒杯争肯忍当时。\n豫章地暖矜千尺，越峤天寒愧一枝。\n还有钓鱼蓑笠在，不堪风雨失归期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}